# Stable spec ID: iba-vesper. Source checked 2026-10-12. Machine generated; not human reviewed.

::ingredients
(gin) 45 ml
(vodka) 15 ml
(aperitif wine @ Lillet Blanc) 7.5 ml

::equipment
(cocktail shaker)
(cocktail glass)

::instructions
<shake, all measured ingredients with ice in (cocktail shaker)>
<strain, into a chilled (cocktail glass)>
<garnish, with lemon zest>

